## Objective

Transform GitHub Copilot into a context-efficient enterprise engineering system capable of:

- Reducing context bloat
- Reducing token waste
- Preventing repetitive reasoning
- Preserving architectural consistency
- Preserving long-session reasoning quality
- Improving repository-scale performance
- Improving multi-file reasoning stability
- Improving large-repository navigation
- Improving deterministic engineering behavior

This skill is inspired by:
- context compression strategies
- retrieval-first reasoning
- architecture-aware prompting
